    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "problemStatement": "Given N disks placed on the source rod, move all disks to the destination rod using the auxiliary rod. Only one disk may be moved at a time, and a larger disk may never be placed on top of a smaller disk. Print the sequence of moves and the total number of moves.",
